                        "entry_id": "6b0869ec-ab13-3624-a17d-6c1f6b3a30a2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An act or instance of cutting (removing) with or as if with scissors, especially an act of cutting and censoring a film."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively",
                            "often",
                            "uncommon"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "38f14811-2a68-4d2b-a22a-dcf35226a225",
                                "sense_id": "56f41cd0-3da9-34d1-bf33-0f3c86c15021",
                                "text": "It's got plenty to make them blanch if and when it is shown them, although the New York State censor board okayed it with insignificant scissorings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0f11b57a-038f-4497-a6f7-c45215b9db4e",
                                "sense_id": "56f41cd0-3da9-34d1-bf33-0f3c86c15021",
                                "text": "The outrage that greeted The Silence—howls of bishops, scissorings of censors, even feces-smeared toilet paper sent to the director—denoted public horror at a morally serious moviemaker surrendering (it seemed) […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "27774acb-3494-3a17-9c11-3e0760fc5056",
                        "entry_id": "6b0869ec-ab13-3624-a17d-6c1f6b3a30a2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A clipping; something cut out (e.g. of a newspaper) with scissors."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated",
                            "possibly",
                            "uncommon"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c59d4584-29ef-4a45-9eca-46a76775980d",
                                "sense_id": "27774acb-3494-3a17-9c11-3e0760fc5056",
                                "text": "The whole work looks very much like somebody's scrapbook, a decidedly good one, however, scissorings from the current literature of the last ten years, with a moderate infusion of extracts from earlier sources, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8671aede-13f8-4ee9-bb3d-9da397a3ba02",
                                "sense_id": "27774acb-3494-3a17-9c11-3e0760fc5056",
                                "text": "A THEOLOGICAL paper: devoted to acrimonious debates about abstruse doctrines.\nA WEEKLY SCRAP paper: made up of scissorings from other newspapers."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
